    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-oldenborn-furrykin=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"The sky was the first road. You remember that road in the bones of your feet.\"</em></p><p><strong>Skywalker (1/Soma Break).</strong> Action — call the wind to hold you up. For 1 minute, walk on air, ash, falling rain, or any equivalent surface as if it were solid ground. Move at your normal walking speed in any direction including straight up. Falling damage negated for the duration. Ends early if you fall unconscious or dismiss it.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"oldStormSkywalker\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Skywalker</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action (1-min duration) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">1 min: walk on air/ash/rain as solid ground, move any direction (up included), fall damage negated.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
